</table>
<p>Items discovered after tear-off are normally added through a <a href="/services/insurance-claim-supplements/">claim supplement</a>, supported by photos taken while the roof is open. If you already have the insurer&rsquo;s numbers, our article on <a href="/how-to-review-underpaid-roof-insurance-estimate/">reviewing an underpaid roof estimate</a> walks through the process.</p>
